  <datafield tag="500" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
    <subfield code="a">Like a split-page book, the box holds three stacks of cards that the reader may turn to mix up heads, torsos, and feet. The text is on the verso of the cards.</subfield>
  </datafield>
  <datafield tag="500" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
    <subfield code="a">"The text of this project is excerpted from a manuscript that the artist discovered while in residency at the American Antiquarian Society. The handwritten pages ... comprised the transcript for a series of congressional hearings held in 1871. The purpose of the hearings was to gain information about the activities of the group known at the time as the Ku Klux ..."--Colophon.</subfield>
  </datafield>
  <datafield tag="500" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
    <subfield code="a">"The physical form of this project is based on The Exquisite Corpse, a literary game"--Colophon.</subfield>
